{"title":{"en":"Multi-stem Birch","de":"Mehrstämmige Birke"},"summary":{"en":"A multi-stem silver birch (Betula pendula) of about 12 m: three slender, slightly splayed white stems grow from one stool, with ascending branches that end in light, airy crowns of small leaves and pendulous twigs; dark lenticels mark the white bark and the stem bases are dark and fissured.","de":"Eine mehrstämmige Sandbirke (Betula pendula) von etwa 12 m: drei schlanke, leicht gespreizte weiße Stämme wachsen aus einem Stock, mit aufsteigenden Ästen, die in leichten, luftigen Kronen aus kleinen Blättern und hängenden Zweigen enden; dunkle Lentizellen zeichnen die weiße Rinde, die Stammbasen sind dunkel und rissig."},"tags":["tree","deciduous","broadleaf","multi-stem","pendulous","wind","transpiration"],"provenance":{"author":"Semio staffage vegetation content worker","method":"handcrafted","created":"2026-10-29","references":[{"id":"wood-handbook-2021","citation":"Forest Products Laboratory (2021). Wood Handbook: Wood as an Engineering Material. General Technical Report FPL-GTR-282, USDA Forest Service. Chapter 5 (green density, modulus of elasticity and rupture; closest listed species used as proxy)."},{"id":"en-1991-1-4","citation":"EN 1991-1-4:2005 Eurocode 1, Actions on structures, Part 1-4: Wind actions. Air density 1.25 kg/m3, F = 0.5 rho cd A v^2, peak velocity pressure (1 + 7 Iv) q_m."},{"id":"en-1991-1-3","citation":"EN 1991-1-3:2003 Eurocode 1, Actions on structures, Part 1-3: Snow loads. Used for the order of magnitude of snow and ice accretion (about 10 kg/m2 on plan area)."},{"id":"mayhead-1973","citation":"Mayhead, G. J. (1973). Some drag coefficients for British forest trees derived from wind tunnel studies. Agricultural Meteorology 12, 123-130."},{"id":"koerner-1979","citation":"Koerner, C., Scheel, J. A. and Bauer, H. (1979). Maximum leaf diffusive conductance in vascular plants. Photosynthetica 13(1), 45-82."},{"id":"jones-2014","citation":"Jones, H. G. (2014). Plants and Microclimate, 3rd ed., Cambridge University Press. Leaf energy balance, leaf area index, boundary-layer conductance."},{"id":"monteith-unsworth-2013","citation":"Monteith, J. L. and Unsworth, M. H. (2013). Principles of Environmental Physics, 4th ed., Academic Press. Penman-Monteith leaf transpiration."},{"id":"pretzsch-2015","citation":"Pretzsch, H., Biber, P., Uhl, E. et al. (2015). Crown size and growing space requirement of common tree species in urban centres, parks, and forests. Urban Forestry and Urban Greening 14(3), 466-479."}],"notes":{"en":"Three stems with separate trunk bones, so each stem sways with its own phase. Masses are volume times green density (Betula papyrifera of the Wood Handbook as proxy) plus foliage estimates. Winter-bare geometry is not offered because shapes cannot be toggled by a pose; the third and fourth poses are a gale and ice-laden bending.","de":"Drei Stämme mit eigenen Stammknochen, sodass jeder Stamm mit eigener Phase schwingt. Massen sind Volumen mal Frischholzdichte (Betula papyrifera des Wood Handbook als Proxy) plus Laubschätzungen. Eine winterkahle Geometrie wird nicht angeboten, da Formen durch eine Pose nicht ausgeblendet werden können; dritte und vierte Pose sind ein Sturm und die eisbeladene Biegung."}},"dimensions":{"heightM":13,"widthM":8.5,"depthM":7,"massKg":660},"materials":[{"id":"birch-bark","title":{"en":"White birch bark","de":"Weiße Birkenrinde"},"emissivity":0.93,"solarAbsorptivity":0.4,"densityKgM3":600,"conductivityWmK":0.1,"source":"authored-estimate","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"birch-bark-base","title":{"en":"Dark fissured birch bark at the stool","de":"Dunkle rissige Birkenrinde am Stock"},"emissivity":0.95,"solarAbsorptivity":0.8,"densityKgM3":650,"conductivityWmK":0.12,"source":"authored-estimate","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"birch-leaf","title":{"en":"Birch leaves","de":"Birkenblätter"},"emissivity":0.97,"solarAbsorptivity":0.45,"source":"literature","reference":"jones-2014"},{"id":"birch-wood","title":{"en":"Green birch wood","de":"Frisches Birkenholz"},"emissivity":0.9,"solarAbsorptivity":0.6,"densityKgM3":900,"conductivityWmK":0.15,"elasticModulusPa":8100000000.0,"strengthPa":44000000.0,"source":"literature","reference":"wood-handbook-2021"}],"poses":[{"id":"calm","title":{"en":"Calm summer day","de":"Windstiller Sommertag"},"description":{"en":"Light air of 1.5 m/s at 10 m: the three stems stand at rest, drag per foliage cloud is 2 to 4 N.","de":"Leiser Zug von 1,5 m/s in 10 m Höhe: Die drei Stämme stehen in Ruhe, der Widerstand je Laubwolke beträgt 2 bis 4 N."},"bones":{"fol-c-top":{"angleDeg":0.4},"fol-l-top":{"angleDeg":-0.3},"fol-r-top":{"angleDeg":0.3}},"ground":"authored","contacts":[],"thermal":{"operating":{},"emitters":{"transpiration-top":0.8,"transpiration-l":0.8}},"loads":[{"id":"wind-fol-l-a","kind":"wind","title":{"en":"Wind drag on foliage, left upper","de":"Winddruck auf Laub links oben"},"bone":"fol-l-a","x":1.5,"y":0,"fxN":3.0,"fyN":0,"source":"literature","reference":"en-1991-1-4"},
